# Exception: the prebuilt DDI vector index (328 KB) ships with the repo.
# ddi_chromadb/chroma.sqlite3 is tracked and references VECTOR segment b8e07864-…;
# without these .bin files a clone gets a manifest declaring 51 embeddings with no
# vectors on disk and the RAG lookup returns nothing. build_ddi_db.py can only
# rebuild it with network access to ddinter.scbdd.com plus a live Ollama, and it is
# not an install step — so vendor it complete.
!ddi_chromadb/**/*.bin
